  "result": "Fixed! The issue was in `src/lib/mentions.ts`:\n\n1. **`extractMentions`** (the key fix for notifications): Now uses `withoutCode(body)` before matching mentions, so code blocks are properly excluded from the extraction. This function is called by `resolveMentions`, which determines notification recipients.\n\n2. **`highlightMentions`** (for consistent display): Now tracks code block ranges and skips highlighting mentions inside them, preserving the original body structure.\n\nThe `withoutCode()` helper already existed to strip code blocks but was never being called, so mentions inside fenced code blocks were being incorrectly extracted and triggering notifications.",
